fullDescription.text:
Detects JSON files that can be interpreted as a part of OpenAPI/Swagger specification. Such files do not contain explicit specification attributes, but they are referenced from primary specification files located nearby. The following example contains two files located in the same directory. First one is a plain primary specification file. Second is referenced from the first one and thus is suggested to be considered a specification too. Primary specification file 'openapi.yaml': 'openapi: 3.1.0
components:
  schemas:
    CustomSchema:
      description: Custom schema object
      properties:
        foo:
          $ref: 'common.components.json#/components/schemas/CommonSchema'' Specification file candidate 'common.components.json': '{
  "components": { // 'Mark file as OpenAPI specification' highlighting
    "schemas": {
      "CommonSchema": {
        "description": "Common schema object reused in several specifications"
      }
    }
  }
}' Inspection ID: SwJsonMaybeSpecificationInspection

Reports conflicting properties in an HCL block. Example of a problem: 'provider "kubernetes" {
