Reports duplicate providers. Example of a problem: 'provider "kubernetes" {
  config_path = "~/.kube/config"
}

provider "kubernetes" {
  config_path = "~/kube/kubeconfig-0728633f-2c4a-4d2b-9eb7-bc629d5e7f37"
}'
 One of the ways to solve this problem is to add an alias and explicitly specify it when creating resources in the required provider. Example of correction: 'provider "kubernetes" {
