fullDescription.markdown:
Reports duplicate providers.

Example of a problem:


    provider "kubernetes" {
      config_path = "~/.kube/config"
    }

    provider "kubernetes" {
      config_path = "~/kube/kubeconfig-0728633f-2c4a-4d2b-9eb7-bc629d5e7f37"
